   "bio": "Teresa A. McGuire was born about 1905 at Plymouth in Luzerne County, Pennsylvania, the daughter of James McGuire and Anna C. Jones. As a small girl she was living in her father's household at Larksville in 1910, where her name was written Theresa. She married Samuel A. Powell at Wilkes-Barre on 3 September 1934.\n\nShe died at Nanticoke on 31 March 1998, aged ninety-four, and was buried in St. Mary's Cemetery, Hanover Township.",
