   "bio": "Elizabeth Thompson was a daughter of John Thompson, Esq., of Setauket. She was born about 1657 and died about 1718, both at New Haven, Connecticut, though one account places her life from about 1647 to about 1719. She married Job Smith, who is recorded as having \"married Elizabeth, daughter of John Thompson, Esq., of Setauket\", and she bore him seven children.\n\nOlder family histories gave her mother as Hannah Brewster of the Mayflower family, with the Rev. William Thompson as her grandfather, but that has since been disproven. John Thompson's only recorded wife was Mary, whose surname is unknown, and the Hannah Brewster in this family married John's son Samuel.",
