     "description": "Married Thomas A. Boyle (b. 7 Nov 1866 in Ireland, miner, of Hazle Twp), by Rev. E. W. Fitzmaurice. Licence No. 21146 was issued 13 Oct 1896. She gave her birth as 10 Sept 1868 at Hazleton, occupation general housework. [R4-S1]"
