   "bio": "Mary Meier was born Maria Mayer at Munzingen on 3 September 1864, at four in the afternoon, and was baptized the next day as the \"legitimate daughter of the local citizen and mason Friedrich Mayer and Marianna Birkenmaier, both Catholic\". Some records give her birth year as 1865, but the Munzingen baptism settles it as 1864. She was a sister of John's 2nd-great-grandfather Henry J. Meier.\n\nIn Pennsylvania she married Henry Rose at Hazleton in 1885 and had four daughters, among them Josephine, who named her mother at her own marriage to a Flynn in 1920. Mary died at Hazleton, Luzerne County, on 9 December 1938 and was buried there.",
   "openQuestions": [
    "PA death index 1938 (Rose, Mary, Hazleton, Dec 1938) for the certificate number."
   ],
