   "bio": "Sophia Gertrude Meier was born on 12 November 1880 at Hazleton, Pennsylvania. She was living at Easton when she married George Thomas Duffin, a clerk, there on 3 June 1903. She died at Easton, Northampton County, on 3 April 1909, aged 28, and was buried there.\n\nThere was a twist in the family afterwards: in 1917 her widower George T. Duffin married Agatha Mary Rose, the daughter of Sophia's sister Mary (Meier) Rose, so that his second wife was his first wife's niece. Sophia was John's 3rd-great-aunt.",
