   "bio": "Bridget, whose maiden name is unknown, was born in England in April 1614 and married Henry Tuthill there. The couple sailed for America in 1637, recorded simply as \"Henry Tuthill and wife\". After Henry's death she married, about 1650, William Wells, Gent., of Southold, who became guardian of her Tuthill children John and Elizabeth. Years later her grandson John Tuthill Jr. married Mehitable Wells, William's daughter by his second wife. Bridget is said to have died at Southold in 1650, though the accounts of her last years disagree. She is John's 11th-great-grandmother.",
