   "researchNotes": "The tree's 'Martinus Heitzler + Othilia Schirk, both d. 1728' corresponds to Mathias Haizler and Ottilia Schirk, who lived at the Wehrlehof in Oberried-Vörlinsbach in 1723–24, where children Christian and Eva were born in 1724 (GEDBAS 1262183134/1262183135). The later Wehrlehof Heitzlers (Andreas b. c.1710 × Ottilia Maier; Andreas b. 1731 × Magdalena Maier; Joseph × Maria Rombach) had 'grown poor' and lived in the farm's Stöckle. Correct 'Martinus' to Mathias."
