     "what": "parents",
     "reason": "Named as Sharon M. Petriello's father in the Ancestry tree; his marriage to Mary Cognetti is confirmed by Leo S. Cognetti's 2019 obituary (sister \"Mary Petriello (John)\"), and the 2024 obituary of John T. Petriello Jr. names the parents John and Mary Petriello and sibling \"Sharon Meier (Thomas)\". Parentage (James + Mollie) rests on the tree plus the Round 1/2 analysis that 'Mollie' is James's wife.",
