   "researchNotes": "Fortunato was baptized on 6 March 1822, son of Nicola Ferlaino and Agata Moraca; his godfather came from neighbouring Conflenti ([R4-S1]). He married Rosa (Tommasina) Moraca, daughter of the late Francesco Moraca and Francesca Orlando, on 15 June 1851 ([R4-S2]). Their children in the baptism index are Gennaro (1855), Raffaela (1858), Marianna (1865), Giuseppe Antonio (1868), a first Leopoldo (1870, died at 5 months) and John's ancestor Leopoldo (1871) ([R4-S4]). Fortunato was buried at San Mango on 28 April 1901, aged 82 ([R4-S3]). He thus outlived his wife and saw his son leave for Pennsylvania.",
