   "bio": "Giuseppina Ferlaino was born at San Mango d'Aquino on 26 July 1811 and baptised two days later, the daughter of Vincenzo Ferlaino and Maria Colosimo; an elder sister of the same name, born in March 1810, had died as an infant. The Ferlainos were a long-established San Mango family, recorded in the parish from the 1670s onward.\n\nShe married Carmine Fiorillo, a contadino from Savuto in the Aiello area, in a civil ceremony on 1 March 1840 and in church two days later; their son Domenico was born that December. She was buried at San Mango on 1 February 1877, aged 70. Hers was an earlier Ferlaino-Fiorillo marriage, two generations before Leopoldo Ferlaino married Giuseppina Fiorillo. She is John's maternal 4th-great-grandmother.",
