   "bio": "Raffaele Colosimo was baptized at San Mango d'Aquino on 27 August 1821, the son of Luigi Colosimo and Carmela Moraca. On 24 March 1839, when he was only seventeen, he married Filippina Iera. They had at least ten children between 1840 and 1866, among them John's ancestor Saveria, born in 1848.\n\nFilippina died in 1871, and in October 1872 Raffaele married Maria Luigia Rametta. He died in January 1899 and was buried at San Mango on 18 January. The burial record gives his age as 89, but by his baptism he was 77.",
