     "description": "Married Joseph Daniel Callaghan, 39, clerk, of 500 Bergen Ave, Jersey City NJ (b. Mayfield PA; son of John M. Callaghan, b. England, and Catherine Killer, b. St. Clair PA, both dead). Luzerne licence No. 1829 C was sworn 10 Oct and issued 17 Oct 1936. She was 36, a bookkeeper, of 16 Barney St. Her father is given as Henry Joseph, molder, b. Germany, and her mother as Anna Higgins, b. New Philadelphia, PA. [R4-S1]"
