   "researchNotes": "Paul Jung of Jettenbach and his wife Maria Barbara were parents of Gretha Catharina Jung (d. 1734), wife of Johann Peter Grub.\n\nFamilySearch lists nine children of Paul Jung and Maria Barbara of Jettenbach, born between 1660 and 1687. They include Elisabetha Catharina (c.1674-1734), second wife of Johann Peter Grub, and Maria Sara (c.1678-before 1721), wife of Abraham Lampert ([R4-S1]). The site makes him John's ancestor through 'Gretha Catharina Jung', but that person is a merge (see H0078). His place in John's ancestry is safer through Maria Sara, who was the mother of Elisabetha Margaretha Lampert, John's ancestress. Maria Sara's descent from Paul is a FamilySearch claim with attached baptism entries. The baptism of her daughter Elisabetha Margaretha names her only as Maria Sara."
