   "researchNotes": "Christmann Grub of Oberbrombach and his wife Margaretha were parents of Caspar Grub (b. 1616); through them the file reaches Hanns Grub and Elsa. The file's death year 'about 1933' is a typo, probably for 1633.\n\nFamilySearch has Christmann Grub of Oberbrombach, born in 1576 or 1596, died about 1633 (which confirms that the site's 'about 1933' is a typo for 1633) ([R4-S1]). It names his parents as Hans Grub (b. 1560) and Elsa (d. 1597), his wife as 'Elssa' (born 11 Apr 1597), and his children as Veltes (1615) and Caspar (1616). The 1642 marriage index entry of Caspar Grueb and Elisabetha Birkhert names Christmann Grub as Caspar's father ([R4-S1]). FamilySearch's naming of both Hans's wife and Christmann's wife as Elsa/Elssa, one dying in 1597 and the other born in 1597, looks like a muddle."
