    "note": "Bristol French Church baptism (Lart, Huguenot Soc. London vol. 20 p.9) naming parents André Lamoureux, pilot of Meschers, and Suzanne LaTour; NY French Church baptism 1720 of son Daniel to 'daniel et Jeane la moureux'."
