    "Was 'Prindle' a separate Connecticut family (Waterbury/New Milford Prindles) from Samuel and James 'Pringle'? Harvey says the Pringle name was often pronounced and written Prindle, and that both Pringles and Prindles were among the 1703 New Milford purchasers."
