   "researchNotes": "Johann Peter Grub (1724-1802), presumed brother of Andreas, arrived on the Windsor in 1753 and settled in Williams Twp.\n\nFamilySearch places Johann Peter in Johann Nickel Grub's family, which supports his being Andreas's brother. It gives his birth at Jettenbach on 29 Feb 1724 (baptized at Reichenbach on 5 Mar 1724) and his marriage at Offenbach am Glan on 2 Jan 1749 to Maria Amalia Grill, with children born at Offenbach in 1750 and 1752, just before the 1753 Windsor voyage. It also gives a second wife, Magdalena, about 1759, the 1800 census as 'Peter Krub', and his death on 24 Aug 1802 ([R4-S1])."
