    "[R4-S2] J. Wickham Case, ed., Southold Town Records, vol. 1 (1882), pp. 169-170 (Liber A: recital that William Salmon, after the death of his wife Katherine, widow of Mathew Sinderland, 'married with Sarah Hortton' and died intestate; John Conckelyne Jr. 'tooke to wife the said Sarah Salmon') (primary) https://archive.org/details/southoldtownreco0000jwic",
