    "note": "Rockwell scrapbook (1968) identifies the house owner as Abner Smith (1734–1782), son of Aaron of The Landing; Aaron was a son of Job Smith 1st (Pelletreau pp. 44–45). Caveat (deep-dive): Pelletreau mentions more than one Abner (Aaron's son Abner p. 45; Jacob Smith's 1783 will naming brother Abner p. 50 area; 'Abner Smith, 2nd' m. Nancy dau. of Richard Smith 3rd p. 471), so the house may belong to a different Abner."
