   "bio": "Luigia Roberto was born about 1814 at Bisaccia in the province of Avellino, the daughter of Pasquale di Roberto and Antonia Sena, who were both born in 1777. On 10 July 1835 she married Bartolomeo Fede at Bisaccia, and she was the mother of Angelamaria Fede, which makes her John's 4th-great-grandmother on his mother's side.\n\nHer given name is uncertain. Angelamaria's 1867 marriage record seems to read Luigia, but other sources call her Nunzianna, and Angelamaria named a daughter born about 1885 Nunzianda, following the southern Italian custom of naming daughters after their grandmothers, which supports Nunzianna.",
