   "bio": "Peter Petrillo was born at Scranton, Lackawanna County, Pennsylvania, in 1897 or 1898; the recorded date of 26 July 1897 sits awkwardly close to the January 1897 birth given for his sister Grace, so one of the two dates is probably wrong. He was 12 in 1910, and by 1920 he was working as a laborer for a coal company. He married Ann Horoski, and their son Victor M. Petrillo lived from 1926 to 1989. Peter died on 7 October 1974.",
