   "bio": "Gottlieb Hipp married Maria Catharina Grub, a daughter of Andreas and Maria Elisabeth Grub born on 25 November 1755, on 21 January 1777 in the Easton area of Northampton County, Pennsylvania. He appears in the 1790 census around Easton and Forks Township. The couple were together for the rest of her life: her death entry at St. John's Lutheran Church in Easton, where she died on 19 March 1836, says they had \"lived together 59 years\".\n\nHis will, dated 9 June 1826 and proved on 28 October 1839, names John Grub, Frederic Grub and Elizabeth Michael as his wife's brothers and sister. It is thus a document showing Frederick Grub, John's 5th-great-grandfather, alive in 1826 and confirming him as Catharina's brother.",
