     "description": "The Elizabeth (Capt. Edward Lee, from Rotterdam via Dover), qualified 27 Aug 1733. Its male list (List 30 A) has 'Jacob Server 56', 'Jacob Server, Jun'r 36' and 'Rodolph Server 21'. The signature lists have 'Jacob (X) Server', 'Jacob Surber', 'Jacob Sorber' and 'Rudolff Sorber', and the women's list has 'Fronegh Sorver 54' and 'Barbara Sorver 23'. Identification with this Jacob is speculative. [R4-S1]"
